#: ../../configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración"

#: ../../configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"Worker tuning is done via `TASK_WORKER_*` environment variables. All of "
"them have sane defaults for local development — set them in production as"
" needed."
msgstr ""
"El ajuste del worker se hace vía variables de entorno `TASK_WORKER_*`. "
"Todas tienen valores por defecto razonables para desarrollo local — "
"configuralas en producción según haga falta."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variable"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Default"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Propósito"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Threads processing tasks in parallel."
msgstr "Threads procesando tareas en paralelo."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`5`"
msgstr "`5`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"A task stuck `RUNNING` (worker crash/OOM) is recovered to `READY` after "
"this many minutes."
msgstr ""
"Una tarea que quedó `RUNNING` (crash/OOM del worker) se recupera a "
"`READY` después de estos minutos."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`30`"
msgstr "`30`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Base delay for exponential backoff between retries."
msgstr "Delay base del backoff exponencial entre reintentos."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Fallback polling interval while waiting on `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` (covers "
"deferred tasks whose `run_after` has just elapsed)."
msgstr ""
"Intervalo de polling de respaldo mientras se espera en `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` "
"(cubre tareas diferidas cuyo `run_after` venció sin un `NOTIFY` nuevo)."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"default\"`"
msgstr "`\"default\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Which `DATABASES` alias the worker connects through. Point this at a "
"separate alias (with its own pool sized for `TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + "
"1`) if you don't want the worker sharing a connection pool with your web "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Qué alias de `DATABASES` usa el worker para conectarse. Apuntá esto a un "
"alias separado (con su propio pool dimensionado para "
"`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + 1`) si no querés que el worker comparta el "
"connection pool con tu proceso web."

#: ../../configuration.md:13
msgid ""
"A CLI flag (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) always overrides its "
"corresponding environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Un flag de CLI (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) siempre tiene prioridad "
"sobre la variable de entorno correspondiente."
